  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of the General Hospital for &quot;the National Fund for Social Security&quot; Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to support the Government of Djibouti&apos;s efforts in tackling the increasing burden of communicable and non-communicable diseases that impact the country&apos;s social wellbeing and economic productivity. To achieve this, the project aims to enhance access to and quality of specialized healthcare services by establishing General Hospital in Djibouti.</narrative>
  </description>
